1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,560
老板们别再为AI焦虑了
Business owners, stop worrying about AI.

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:05,380
别让你的短板去跟别人的长板拼
Do not pit your weaknesses against someone else's strengths.

3
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:08,680
现在满世界都是懂AI但是不懂行业的人
There are people everywhere who understand AI, but not your industry.

4
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:11,320
套个壳呢就敢喊颠覆你这个行业
They put a wrapper on it and claim they will disrupt your industry.

5
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,880
他们会用的是工具
What they know how to use are tools.

6
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,480
而你有的呢是这个行业
And what you have, in this industry,

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,880
摸爬滚打下来的一身实战经验
is hands-on experience earned the hard way.

8
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,460
客户到底为什么掏钱
Why do customers actually pay?

9
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,620
哪个环节呢让你半夜睡不着觉
Which part keeps you awake at night?

10
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:24,520
报价里的水分藏在什么地方啊
Where is the padding hidden in a quote?

11
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,400
这些东西
These things

12
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,600
不在任何一篇AI教程里面
are not in any AI tutorial.

13
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:30,420
全是你一脚一坑踩出来
You learned them by stumbling through them yourself.

14
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:31,680
未来的王者呢
The future winners

15
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,080
是应用洞察加
combine application insight

16
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,280
技能能力的结合
with skills and capability.

17
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,200
对于我们普通人来来说
For ordinary people like us,

18
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:39,540
哪有什么高大上的应用洞察
what is so grand about application insight?

19
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,280
就是你在一个行业里面
It is being in an industry

20
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,320
泡了十年
for ten years,

21
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:44,920
攒下来的那身伤
and the scars you have accumulated.

22
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:48,520
拿这身行业的底子去配AI啊
Pair that industry foundation with AI.

23
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,800
你就是那个既懂淘金
You are the one who understands prospecting

24
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,200
又最先能领到铲子的人
and gets a shovel first.

25
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,660
别搞什么宏大的叙事啊
Forget grand narratives.

26
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:56,620
就是现在一件
Right now, in one...

27
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:58,240
最小的一个场景里面
in the smallest possible scenario,

28
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,040
把钱收回来
get the money back.

29
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:00,095
比什么都管用
That is more useful than anything else.

30
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:02,175
再讲一句反常识的啊
Here is something counterintuitive.

31
00:01:02,730 --> 00:01:05,505
就是别总想着要活到终局
Do not always think about surviving until the end.

32
00:01:05,970 --> 00:01:09,165
先把这十年的钱赚到手
First, earn the money from these ten years.

33
00:01:10,170 --> 00:01:10,730
很多人说啊
Many people say,

34
00:01:10,730 --> 00:01:12,970
其实说现在我做AI的公司
well, the AI companies we are building now

35
00:01:12,970 --> 00:01:14,485
以后大概率都活不下去
will probably not survive.

36
00:01:14,980 --> 00:01:15,645
那个怎么样
So what about that?

37
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:17,725
就是AOL死啊
Say AOL died.

38
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,500
不等于一九九五年
That does not mean that, in 1995,

39
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:21,550
开网吧做网站啊
people running internet cafes or building websites

40
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:24,340
卖黄页的人没赚钱啊
and selling Yellow Pages did not earn money.

41
00:01:24,340 --> 00:01:25,140
黑莓输了
BlackBerry lost.

42
00:01:25,260 --> 00:01:27,325
也不等于最早一批做手机应用的
That does not mean the earliest mobile app

43
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:28,595
团队没有吃到肉
teams did not benefit.

44
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,985
商业史上大把这样的公司啊
Business history has many companies like this.

45
00:01:31,270 --> 00:01:32,490
自己没走到终局
They did not make it to the end.

46
00:01:32,490 --> 00:01:34,345
但是创始人在浪潮里
But their founders, in that wave,

47
00:01:34,590 --> 00:01:36,025
赚足了第一桶金
earned their first pot of gold,

48
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:39,370
攒下了认知团队和胆子啊
and accumulated knowledge, a team and courage.

49
00:01:39,370 --> 00:01:41,365
转身就投入了下一步
Then they invested in the next step.

50
00:01:41,850 --> 00:01:43,210
我们普通人的目标啊
The goal for ordinary people like us

51
00:01:43,210 --> 00:01:45,650
从来不是说是成为下一个OpenAI
has never been to become the next OpenAI.

52
00:01:46,220 --> 00:01:48,520
而是让这轮浪潮
It is to let this wave

53
00:01:48,620 --> 00:01:50,065
实实在在的托你一把
give you a real lift.

54
00:01:50,390 --> 00:01:51,290
咱们轻装上阵啊
Travel light.

55
00:01:51,290 --> 00:01:53,705
保证嗯现金流为正
Make sure, um, your cash flow is positive.

56
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,915
然后用赚到的钱换认知
Then use the money you earn to gain knowledge,

57
00:01:56,310 --> 00:01:58,725
再用认知去抓下一个浪潮
and use that knowledge to catch the next wave.

58
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:00,790
就这么简单啊
It is that simple.

59
00:02:00,790 --> 00:02:02,585
我是超哥在兰州AI创业
I am Chao, building an AI business in Lanzhou.
